N        EQU   16
INPUT    EQU   1000
H        EQU   1100
T        EQU   4
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT3  T-1         D1. Loop on s. s ← t − 1.
1H       LD4   H,3         D2. Loop on j. h ← hs.
         ENT1  INPUT,4     Modify the addresses of three
         ST1   5F(0:2)       instructions in the main loop.
         ST1   6F(0:2)
         ENN1  -N,4        rI1 ← N − h.
         ST1   3F(0:2)
         ENT1  1-N,4       j ← h + 1.
2H       LDA   INPUT+N,1   D3. Set up i, K, R.
3H       ENT2  N-H,1       i ← j − h.  [Instruction modified]
4H       CMPA  INPUT,2     D4. Compare K : Ki.
         JGE   6F          To D6 if K ≥ Ki.
         LDX   INPUT,2     D5. Move Ri, decrease i.
5H       STX   INPUT+H,2   Ri+h ← Ri.  [Instruction modified]
         DEC2  0,4         i ← i − h.
         J2P   4B          To D4 if i > 0.
6H       STA   INPUT+H,2   D6. R into Ri+h. [Instruction modified]
7H       INC1  1           j ← j + 1.
         J1NP  2B          To D3 if j ≤ N.
         DEC3  1
         J3NN  1B          t > s ≥ 0.
         HLT
         END   START
